  "notes": [
    "The reset is the oracle's heartbeat for VGHSTOracle, raised from 1h to 24h: the GHST feed was 6,547s old at the exploit, past the old 5,400s limit, so the exploit needed it. The FeedSet that listed ovGHST and routed it to the oracle came two days earlier.",
    "Loss is each 0VIX market's net underlying outflow; the attacker's flash-financed USDC and USDT deposits net inside the transaction. vGHST has no market series and is valued at the pre-donation vault rate times GHST. The ~$2M often reported is the attacker's profit after the donation and fees."
